  "reviewed_chain": [
    "The independently named CCountryCreation and CCountryFormation RTTI locate the parse interfaces at +0x228 and +0x3d0. Their ai_will_do paths use Country tag 5 and definition-local trigger storage at +0xb0 and +0xa0.",
    "The typed databases install current matching vtables and loaders 0x1417895d0 and 0x141789990 construct and append definitions to database+0x80. Creation gathers via a cultural index while formation iterates its typed database.",
    "The actual AI consumers resolve Country, construct the actor context and test their own trigger member before the native false path advances to the next candidate."
  ],
